{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2020-06-19 19:30:00', 'title': 'FEDEX CONCLUDED THAT NONCASH CHARGE OF APPROXIMATELY $348 MLN FOR IMPAIRMENT OF VALUE OF GOODWILL WOULD NEED TO BE RECORDED IN Q4', 'text': "FEDEX CORP - CONCLUDED THAT NONCASH CHARGE OF APPROXIMATELY $348 MILLION FOR IMPAIRMENT OF VALUE OF GOODWILL WOULD NEED TO BE RECORDED IN Q4.FEDEX CORP - IMPAIRMENT CHARGE RECOGNIZED BASED ON DECLINING PRINT REVENUE AND TEMPORARY STORE CLOSURES AT FEDEX OFFICE DURING Q4.FEDEX CORP - COVID-19 PANDEMIC IS EXPECTED TO CONTINUE TO NEGATIVELY IMPACT FEDEX OFFICE'S NEAR-TERM OPERATING PERFORMANCE.FEDEX CORP - TOTAL ASSET IMPAIRMENT CHARGES FOR Q4 ENDED MAY 31, 2020 ARE EXPECTED TO BE ABOUT $370 MILLION."}